Z||000000||Uaana||02-29-2000||05:59 AM||||Sorry just had to vent somewhere!<BR>Went to the local self wash to rinse off some<BR>of the winter muck (it's been 50f) And since<BR>the wash has a low pressure hose thought I'd<BR>rinse off the engine too.. Yes it was cool.<BR>Anyways finished off the car and you guessed it kaput!! checked the wires and found that my coil wire connection had the consistency of used baby powder.. so now it sits in the wash bay until the parts store opens.....<BR>Guess that explains the occasional hesitation at constant speeds anyways.... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||8
